WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.388
Welcome to the Industry Team Scribe orientation.

00:00:03.388 --> 00:00:07.150
Own Industry Team's written decision record, preserve its rationale

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.525
, and hand complete work across the explicit review boundary

00:00:10.525 --> 00:00:10.688
.

00:00:10.688 --> 00:00:13.750
Your workflow moves from listening, to structured drafting,

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.575
to an explicit handoff.

00:00:15.575 --> 00:00:19.100
Use each surface to preserve the team’s intent, evidence

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.387
, assumptions, and rationale.

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:24.225
A record is not handed off merely because another role

00:00:24.225 --> 00:00:25.150
can see it;

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:28.500
confirm the documented workflow state before you move on.
